sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant EP as CommentEndpoints
    participant CS as CommentService
    participant CSP as ContentSubmissionPipeline
    participant MP as MentionParsingService
    participant DB as AppDbContext / PostgreSQL
    participant SF as SpamFlaggingService
    participant ND as NotificationDispatcher
    participant Hub as NotificationHub (SignalR)
    actor R as Recipient (connected client)

    U->>EP: POST /api/posts/{postId}/comments {body, parentCommentId?}
    EP->>CS: CreateAsync(postId, authorId, body, parentCommentId)
    CS->>DB: verify post exists & not locked,<br/>check CommunityBan / PlatformRestriction
    CS->>CSP: EvaluateAsync(body, ContentType = Comment)
    CSP-->>CS: IsBlocked?

    alt PII blocked
        CS-->>EP: throws PiiDetectedException
        EP-->>U: 400
    else allowed
        CS->>DB: INSERT Comment
        CS->>SF: FlagIfSpamAsync(CommentId, ...)
        CS->>MP: ExtractMentionedUsersAsync(body)
        MP-->>CS: mentioned usernames[]

        opt reply to a comment or post
            CS->>ND: DispatchAsync(parentAuthorId, Reply, Comment, commentId)
        end
        loop each @mention (not deduped against the Reply notification)
            CS->>ND: DispatchAsync(mentionedUserId, Mention, Comment, commentId)
        end

        ND->>DB: INSERT Notification
        ND->>Hub: Clients.Group("user:{recipientId}").ReceiveNotification(...)
        Hub-->>R: real-time push (if connected,<br/>row persists either way for later polling)

        CS-->>EP: CommentResponse
        EP-->>U: 201 Created
    end
